      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُحْمَةٌ</span></b>  <i>Blackness;</i> (S, Msb, K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَحَمٌ</span></b> ,
[mentioned above as inf. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَحِمَ</span>,] and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُحَامٌ</span></b> ;
(K;) like [<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُخْمَةٌ</span> and] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَخَمٌ</span>: (TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سخم</span>:)
<i>a blackness like the colour of the crow to which
the epithet</i> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَسْحَمُ</span></b>  <i>is applied.</i> (Lth, TA.)

